#: about.php include/global_arrays.php include/top_general_header.php
#: include/top_header.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Oor Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti is ontwerp om 'n volledige grafiekoplossing te wees wat gebaseer is op die RRDtool-tydreeksdatabasis (TSDB) en grafiekoplossing. Die doel daarvan is om die netwerkadministrateur se werk makliker te maak deur al die belangrike besonderhede te hanteer wat nodig is om betekenisvolle grafieke te skep."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Raadpleeg asseblief die amptelike %1$sCacti-webwerf%2$s vir inligting oor hoe om Cacti te gebruik, ondersteuning te kry en opdaterings te bekom."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktiewe ontwikkelaars"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Ontwikkelaars wat aan Cacti, sy argitektuur, dokumentasie en toekomstige vrystellings werk."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Eervolle vermeldings"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Bydraers tot dokumentasie, QA, verpakking, die forums en ons YouTube-bladsy."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Emeritus-lede"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Lede van die oorspronklike Cacti-groep wat sedertdien in hul loopbane aanbeweeg het. Ons wens hulle steeds alles van die beste toe."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Dankie"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "'n Baie spesiale dankie aan %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, die skepper van %3$sRRDtool%4$s en die baie gewilde %5$sMRTG%6$s."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Die gebruikers van Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Veral enigiemand wat die tyd geneem het om 'n probleemverslag in te dien, of andersins gehelp het om Cacti-verwante probleme op te los. Ook aan enigiemand wat bygedra het om Cacti te ondersteun."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisensie"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti is gelisensieer onder die GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Hierdie program is vrye sagteware; u kan dit herversprei en/of wysig onder die bepalings van die GNU General Public License soos gepubliseer deur die Free Software Foundation; óf weergawe 2 van die lisensie, óf (na u keuse) enige latere weergawe."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Hierdie program word versprei in die hoop dat dit nuttig sal wees, maar SONDER ENIGE WAARBORG; selfs sonder die geïmpliseerde waarborg van VERHANDELBAARHEID of GESKIKTHEID VIR 'N BEPAALDE DOEL. Sien die GNU General Public License vir meer besonderhede."

