#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Bulk Walk-maksimum herhalings"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Vir SNMPv2- en SNMPv3-toestelle, die SNMP Bulk Walk maksimum-herhalingsgrootte. Die verstek is 'Bespeur outomaties by herindeksering'. Vir baie groot skakelaars, hoëprestasie-bedieners, Jumbo Frame-netwerke of vir hoëlatensie-WAN-verbindings kan die verhoging van hierdie waarde die peilerprestasie verbeter. Meer data word in 'n enkele SNMP-pakkie verpak, wat datanavraaglooptyd kan verminder. Sommige toestelle kan egter heeltemal weier om te reageer op pakkies met 'n maksimum-herhalingsgrootte wat te groot gestel is. Dit kan veral waar wees vir lae-krag IoT-tipe toestelle of kleiner ingebedde IT-toestelle. Spesiale aandag moet ook gegee word aan die algehele netwerkpad-MTU, aangesien die stel van 'n waarde wat te hoog is, tot pakkiefragmentasie kan lei."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect on Re-Index"
msgstr "Bespeur outomaties by herindeksering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Bespeur/stel outomaties by eerste herindeksering"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Repetition"
msgstr "%d herhaling"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Repetitions"
msgstr "%d herhalings"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum number of attempts to reach a device via an SNMP readstring prior to giving up."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal pogings om 'n toestel via 'n SNMP-leesstring te bereik voordat daar gestaak word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A useful name for this Data Storage and Polling Profile."
msgstr "'n Nuttige naam vir hierdie databergings- en peilprofiel."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "New Profile"
msgstr "Nuwe profiel"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Polling Interval"
