#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Based upon the number of Rows and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this RRA in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Gebaseer op die aantal rye en die aantal geselekteerde konsolidasiefunksies, die grootte van hierdie RRA in die RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A useful name for this CDEF."
msgstr "'n Nuttige naam vir hierdie CDEF."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name of this Color."
msgstr "Die naam van hierdie kleur."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Hex Value"
msgstr "Hekswaarde"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The hex value for this color; valid range: 000000-FFFFFF."
msgstr "Die hekswaarde vir hierdie kleur; geldige reeks: 000000-FFFFFF."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Any named color should be read only."
msgstr "Enige benoemde kleur moet leesalleen wees."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a meaningful name for this data input method."
msgstr "Voer 'n betekenisvolle naam vir hierdie data-invoermetode in."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Input Type"
msgstr "Invoertipe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose the method you wish to use to collect data for this Data Input method."
msgstr "Kies die metode wat jy wil gebruik om data vir hierdie data-invoermetode in te samel."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Input String"
msgstr "Invoerstring"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data that is sent to the script, which includes the complete path to the script and input sources in &lt;&gt; brackets."
msgstr "Die data wat na die skrip gestuur word, wat die volledige pad na die skrip en invoerbronne in &lt;&gt;-hakies insluit."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "White List Check"
msgstr "Witlyskontrole"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The result of the Whitespace verification check for the specific Input Method.  If the Input String changes, and the Whitelist file is not updated, Graphs will not be allowed to be created."
msgstr "Die resultaat van die witspasie-verifikasiekontrole vir die spesifieke invoermetode. As die invoerstring verander en die witlyslêer nie bygewerk word nie, sal grafieke nie geskep kan word nie."

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Field [%s]"
msgstr "Veld [%s]"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Choose the associated field from the %s field."
msgstr "Kies die geassosieerde veld uit die %s-veld."

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "Enter a name for this %s field.  Note: If using name value pairs in your script, for example: NAME:VALUE, it is important that the name matches your output field name identically to the script output name or names."
msgstr "Voer 'n naam vir hierdie %s-veld in. Let wel: As jy naam-waarde-pare in jou skrip gebruik, byvoorbeeld: NAME:VALUE, is dit belangrik dat die naam presies ooreenstem met jou afvoerveldnaam en die skripafvoernaam of -name."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Update RRDfile"
msgstr "Werk RRDfile by"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether data from this output field is to be entered into the RRDfile."
msgstr "Of data vanaf hierdie afvoerveld in die RRDfile ingevoer moet word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Regular Expression Match"
msgstr "Ooreenkoms met gewone uitdrukking"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If you want to require a certain regular expression to be matched against input data, enter it here (preg_match format)."
msgstr "As jy wil vereis dat 'n sekere gewone uitdrukking met invoerdata moet ooreenstem, voer dit hier in (preg_match-formaat)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Allow Empty Input"
msgstr "Laat leë invoer toe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check here if you want to allow NULL input in this field from the user."
msgstr "Merk hier as jy NULL-invoer van die gebruiker in hierdie veld wil toelaat."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Special Type Code"
msgstr "Spesiale tipekode"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "If this field should be treated specially by host templates, indicate so here. Valid keywords for this field are %s"
msgstr "As hierdie veld spesiaal deur gasheersjablone hanteer moet word, dui dit hier aan. Geldige sleutelwoorde vir hierdie veld is %s"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this data template."
msgstr "Die naam wat aan hierdie datasjabloon gegee is."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose a name for this data source.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Kies 'n naam vir hierdie databron. Dit kan vervangingsveranderlikes soos |host_description| of |query_fieldName| insluit. Vir 'n volledige lys van ondersteunde vervangingsmerkers, raadpleeg asseblief die Cacti-dokumentasie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Path"
msgstr "Databronpad"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The full path to the RRDfile."
msgstr "Die volledige pad na die RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The script/source used to gather data for this data source."
msgstr "Die skrip/bron wat gebruik word om data vir hierdie databron in te samel."

#: include/global_form.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Data Source Profile.  The Data Source Profile controls polling interval, the data aggregation, and retention policy for the resulting Data Sources."
msgstr "Kies die databronprofiel. Die databronprofiel beheer die peilinterval, die data-aggregasie en die behoudbeleid vir die gevolglike databronne."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The amount of time in seconds between expected updates."
msgstr "Die hoeveelheid tyd in sekondes tussen verwagte bywerkings."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Active"
msgstr "Databron aktief"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether Cacti should gather data for this data source or not."
msgstr "Of Cacti data vir hierdie databron moet insamel of nie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Internal Data Source Name"
msgstr "Interne databronnaam"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose unique name to represent this piece of data inside of the RRDfile."
msgstr "Kies 'n unieke naam om hierdie stuk data binne die RRDfile te verteenwoordig."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Minimum Value (\"U\" for No Minimum)"
msgstr "Minimum waarde (\"U\" vir geen minimum)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Die minimum waarde van data wat toegelaat word om ingesamel te word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Maximum Value (\"U\" for No Maximum)"
msgstr "Maksimum waarde (\"U\" vir geen maksimum)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Die maksimum waarde van data wat toegelaat word om ingesamel te word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Data Source Type"
msgstr "Databrontipe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is represented in the RRA."
msgstr "Hoe data in die RRA voorgestel word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time that can pass before data is entered as 'unknown'. (Usually 2x300=600)"
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat kan verloop voordat data as 'onbekend' ingevoer word. (Gewoonlik 2x300=600)"

#: include/global_form.php lib/html_utility.php
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Nie gekies nie"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Wanneer data ingesamel word, sal die data vir hierdie veld in hierdie databron geplaas word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Voer 'n naam vir hierdie GPRINT-voorafinstelling in; maak seker dit is iets wat jy herken."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "GPRINT-teks"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Voer die pasgemaakte GPRINT-string hier in."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Algemene opsies"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Titel (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Die naam wat op die grafiek gedruk word. Dit kan vervangingsveranderlikes soos |host_description| of |query_fieldName| insluit. Vir 'n volledige lys van ondersteunde vervangingsmerkers, raadpleeg asseblief die Cacti-dokumentasie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Vertikale etiket (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Die etiket wat vertikaal links van die grafiek gedruk word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Beeldformaat (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Die tipe grafiek wat gegenereer word; PNG, GIF of SVG. Die keuse van grafiekbeeldtipe hang baie van RRDtool af."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Hoogte (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Die hoogte (in piksels) van die grafiekarea binne die grafiek. Hierdie area sluit nie die legende, aslegendes of titel in nie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Breedte (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Die breedte (in piksels) van die grafiekarea binne die grafiek. Hierdie area sluit nie die legende, aslegendes of titel in nie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Basiswaarde (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Moet op 1024 gestel word vir geheue en 1000 vir verkeersmetings."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label Angle (--vertical-label-angle)"
msgstr "Vertikale etikethoek (--vertical-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "RRDtool Default"
msgstr "RRDtool-verstek"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank uses the RRDtool default. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Etiketrotasie in grade antikloksgewys. Vereis RRDtool 1.11 of nuwer. Leeg gebruik die RRDtool-verstek. Ander hoeke as 90 en 270 kan nabygeleë inhoud oorvleuel."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Hellingsmodus (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Die gebruik van hellingsmodus maak die vorm van die grafieke gladder ten koste van 'n bietjie skermresolusie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Skaleringsopsies"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Outomatiese skalering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Skaleer die y-as outomaties in plaas daarvan om 'n boonste en onderste limiet te definieer. Let wel: as dit gemerk is, sal beide die boonste en onderste limiet geïgnoreer word."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Opsies vir outomatiese skalering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Gebruik <br> --alt-autoscale om na die absolute minimum en maksimum te skaleer <br> --alt-autoscale-max om na die maksimum waarde te skaleer met behulp van 'n gegewe onderste limiet <br> --alt-autoscale-min om na die minimum waarde te skaleer met behulp van 'n gegewe boonste limiet <br> --alt-autoscale (met limiete) om met beide onderste en boonste limiete te skaleer (RRDtool-verstek) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Gebruik --alt-autoscale (ignoreer gegewe limiete)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Gebruik --alt-autoscale-max (aanvaar 'n onderste limiet)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Gebruik --alt-autoscale-min (aanvaar 'n boonste limiet)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Gebruik --alt-autoscale (aanvaar beide limiete, RRDtool-verstek)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Logaritmiese skalering (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Gebruik logaritmiese y-as-skalering"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "SI-eenhede vir logaritmiese skalering (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Gebruik SI-eenhede vir logaritmiese skalering in plaas van eksponensiële notasie.<br> Let wel: Lineêre grafieke gebruik by verstek SI-notasie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Rigiede grense-modus (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Moenie die onderste en boonste limiet uitbrei as die grafiek 'n waarde buite die geldige reeks bevat nie."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Boonste limiet (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Die maksimum vertikale waarde vir die grafiek."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Onderste limiet (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Die minimum vertikale waarde vir die grafiek."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Roosteropsies"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Eenheid-roosterwaarde (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Stel die eksponentwaarde op die Y-as vir getalle. Let wel: Hierdie opsie is verouderd en vervang deur die --y-grid-opsie. In hierdie opsie verskyn Y-as-roosterlyne by elke roosterstap-interval. Etikette word elke etiketfaktor-lyne geplaas."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Eenheid-eksponentwaarde (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Watter eenheid Cacti op die Y-as moet gebruik. Gebruik 3 om alles in \"k\" te vertoon of -6 om alles in \"u\" (mikro) te vertoon."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Eenheidlengte (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Hoeveel syfers moet RRDtool aanneem die y-as-etikette is? Jy sal dalk hierdie opsie moet gebruik om genoeg spasie te maak sodra jy aan die y-as-etikettering begin peuter."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Geen roosterpassing (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Om anti-aliassing-vervaagingseffekte te vermy, klik RRDtool punte vas aan toestelresolusie-piksels; dit lei tot 'n skerper voorkoms. As dit nie na jou sin is nie, kan jy hierdie skakelaar gebruik om hierdie gedrag af te skakel.<br><strong>Let wel: </strong>Roosterpassing is by verstek afgeskakel vir PDF-, EPS- en SVG-afvoer."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternatiewe Y-rooster (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Die algoritme verseker dat jy altyd 'n rooster het, dat daar genoeg maar nie te veel roosterlyne is nie, en dat die rooster metries is. Hierdie parameter sal ook verseker dat jy genoeg desimale vertoon kry, selfs al gaan jou grafiek van 69.998 na 70.001.<br><strong>Let wel: </strong>Hierdie parameter kan inmeng met --alt-autoscale-opsies."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Asopsies"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Regter-as (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "'n Tweede as sal aan die regterkant van die grafiek geteken word. Dit is aan die linker-as gekoppel via die skaal- en verskuiwingsparameters."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Regter-asetiket (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Die etiket vir die regter-as."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "Regter-asetikethoek (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Regteretiket-rotasie in grade antikloksgewys. Vereis RRDtool 1.11 of nuwer. Leeg volg die vertikale etikethoek. Ander hoeke as 90 en 270 kan nabygeleë inhoud oorvleuel."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Regter-asetiketreeks (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Wys slegs regter-asetikette binne min:max, byvoorbeeld 0:100. Enige grens mag leeg wees. Dit verander nie die asskaal nie. Vereis RRDtool 1.11 of nuwer. Leeg laat etikette onbeperk."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Regter-asformaat (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Standaard word die formaat van die as-etikette outomaties bepaal.  As jy dit self wil doen, gebruik hierdie opsie met dieselfde %lf-argumente wat jy ken van die PRINT- en GPRINT-opdragte."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Regteras-formateerder (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formaatnaam&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Wanneer jy die regteras-etikettering opstel, pas 'n reël op die dataformaat toe.  Ondersteunde formate sluit in \"numeric\" waar data as numeries hanteer word, \"timestamp\" waar waardes as UNIX-tydstempels (aantal sekondes sedert Januarie 1970) geïnterpreteer en in strftime-formaat uitgedruk word (standaard is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Sien ook --units-length en --right-axis-format.  Laastens \"duration\" waar waardes as tydsduur in millisekondes geïnterpreteer word.  Formatering volg die reëls van valstrfduration-gekwalifiseerde PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Linkeras-formaat (--left-axis-format &lt;formaat&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Linkeras-formateerder (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formaatnaam&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Wanneer jy die linkeras-etikettering opstel, pas 'n reël op die dataformaat toe.  Ondersteunde formate sluit in \"numeric\" waar data as numeries hanteer word, \"timestamp\" waar waardes as UNIX-tydstempels (aantal sekondes sedert Januarie 1970) geïnterpreteer en in strftime-formaat uitgedruk word (standaard is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Sien ook --units-length.  Laastens \"duration\" waar waardes as tydsduur in millisekondes geïnterpreteer word.  Formatering volg die reëls van valstrfduration-gekwalifiseerde PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Legende-opsies"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Outo-opvulling"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Vul teks op sodat legende- en grafiekdata altyd oplyn. Let wel: dit kan veroorsaak dat grafieke langer neem om te vertoon weens die groter oorhoofse las. Outo-opvulling is moontlik ook nie akkuraat op alle soorte grafieke nie; konsekwente etikettering help gewoonlik."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Dinamiese etikette (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Teken lynmerkers as 'n lyn."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Dwing reëlslegende af (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Dwing die generering van HRULE- en VRULE-legendes af."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Tabwydte (--tabwidth &lt;piksels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Standaard is die tabwydte 40 piksels; gebruik hierdie opsie om dit te verander."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Legendeposisie (--legend-position=&lt;posisie&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Plaas die legende aan die gegewe kant van die grafiek."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
