msgstr "Grafiektoestemmingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Daar is vier metodes om 'n gebruiker se grafiektoestemmings te bepaal. Die eerste is 'Toelatend'. Onder die 'Toelatend'-instelling het 'n gebruiker slegs toegang tot óf die grafiek, toestel óf grafieksjabloon nodig om toegang te verkry tot die grafieke wat op hulle van toepassing is. Onder 'Beperkend' moet die gebruiker toegang hê tot die grafiek, die toestel én die grafieksjabloon om toegang tot die grafiek te verkry. Hierdie eerste twee metodes het skaalbaarheidsprobleme vir baie groot installasies. Dus is twee bykomende opsies beskikbaar. Hulle is 'Toestelgebaseerd', wat beteken dat as u toegang tot die toestel het, u toegang tot sy grafieke kry. En laastens 'Grafieksjabloongebaseerd', wat beteken dat as u toegang tot die 'Grafieksjabloon' het, u toegang kry tot alle toestelgrafieke van daardie sjabloon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Toelatend"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Beperkend"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Toestelgebaseerd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Grafiek-/databronskeppingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Indien op Eenvoudig gestel, kan grafieke en databronne slegs vanuit Nuwe grafieke geskep word. Indien Gevorderd, word ouer grafiek- en databronskepping ondersteun."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Eenvoudig"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Gevorderd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Wys vorm-/instellingshulp inlyn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal vorm- en instellingshulp inlyn gewys word. Andersins sal dit aangebied word wanneer die wyser oor die hulpknoppie beweeg word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Slegs plaaslike bladsyhulp"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "By verstek is Cacti-bladsyhulp geleë by docs.cacti.net. As u stelsel egter nie toegang tot die internet het nie, kan u die dokumentasie plaaslik in HTML-formaat aflaai en dit in die 'docs'-ligging van u Cacti-bediener huisves. As u kies om slegs die plaaslike ligging vir bladsyhulpdokumentasie te gebruik, merk hierdie merkblokkie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Skrappingverifikasie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Vra gebruiker voordat item geskrap word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Voorafinstelling vir databronbewaring"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Cacti die keuseknoppie stel om verwante databronne van 'n grafiek te skrap wanneer grafieke verwyder word. Let wel: Cacti sal nie die verwydering van databronne toelaat as dit in ander grafieke gebruik word nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Outo-ontsluiting van grafieke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Cacti nie grafieke sluit nie. Dit laat 'n vinniger handmatige wysiging van databronne verwant aan 'n grafiek toe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Versteek Cacti-kontroleskerm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Vir gebruik met Cacti se eksterne skakelondersteuning. Deur hierdie instelling te gebruik, kan u die Cacti-kontroleskerm versteek sodat u net u eie bladsy kan vertoon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Aktiveer sleep-en-los"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Sommige van Cacti se koppelvlakke ondersteun sleep-en-los. Indien gemerk, sal hierdie opsie geaktiveer word. Let wel: Vir siggestremde gebruikers kan hierdie opsie gedeaktiveer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "GitHub/GitLab API-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "Basis-API-bewaarplek-URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "As u die nuutste inpropweergawes direk vanaf GitHub of GitLab wil kry, voer die GitHub- of GitLab-API-URL hier in. Die verstekwaarde is https://api.github.com/. Verander dit slegs as u u eie bewaarplek het wat u vir Cacti-inproppe onderhou."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub User Account"
msgstr "GitHub-gebruikersrekening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The User account that holds your GitHub/GitLab repositories.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Die gebruikersrekening wat u GitHub/GitLab-bewaarplekke hou. Verander dit slegs as u u eie bewaarplek het wat u vir Cacti-inproppe onderhou."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Personal Access Token"
msgstr "Persoonlike toegangsteken"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub without overly restricted rate limiting, enter your Personal Access Token here."
msgstr "As u die nuutste inpropweergawes direk vanaf GitHub wil kry sonder oormatig beperkte tempobeperking, voer u persoonlike toegangsteken hier in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Unsafe Plugin Installs"
msgstr "Aktiveer onveilige inpropinstallasies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you would like to allow the installation of Cacti Plugins from their 'develop' branch, check this checkbox."
msgstr "As u die installering van Cacti-inproppe vanaf hul 'develop'-tak wil toelaat, merk hierdie merkblokkie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Package Creation Defaults"
msgstr "Verstekwaardes vir pakketskepping"

#: include/global_settings.php package.php
msgid "Author Name"
msgstr "Outeursnaam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the author that you wish published with the Device Template or Package."
msgstr "Die naam van die outeur wat u saam met die toestelsjabloon of pakket gepubliseer wil hê."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Author Email Address"
msgstr "Outeur se e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email address of the author that you wish published with the Device Template or Package."
msgstr "Die e-posadres van die outeur wat u saam met die toestelsjabloon of pakket gepubliseer wil hê."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Template/Package Copyright"
msgstr "Sjabloon-/pakketkopiereg"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default copyright that you would like to use for your packaged Device Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Die verstek kopiereg wat u vir u verpakte toestelsjablone en pakkette wil gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Package/Template Import Defaults"
msgstr "Verstekwaardes vir pakket-/sjablooninvoer"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Package Location"
msgstr "Pakketligging"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Location of the Packages that you wish to Import."
msgstr "Kies die ligging van die pakkette wat u wil invoer."

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Suggested Value Patterns"
msgstr "Vervang voorgestelde waardepatrone"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Vervang databron- en grafieksjabloonrekords vir voorgestelde waardes. Grafieke en databronne sal nuwe name aanneem ná óf 'n datanavraag-herindeksering óf deur die gedwonge Vervang voorgestelde waardes-proses te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Werfsekuriteit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Dwing verbindings oor HTTPS af"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal enige pogings om toegang tot Cacti te verkry na HTTPS herlei word om hoë sekuriteit te verseker."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Inlyn JavaScript-beskerming"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Beheer hoe die Content-Security-Policy inlyn-JavaScript beperk.  HTMX behou die 'unsafe-inline'-beleid waarop alle huidige temas en inproppe staatmaak en stem ooreen met die gedrag van vorige vrystellings.  Nonce-migrasie gee 'n streng nonce-beleid in slegs-verslag-modus uit sodat onversoenbare kern- en inpropskrifte geïdentifiseer kan word sonder om die UI te breek.  Nonce-afdwinging blokkeer skrifte sonder die versoek-nonce en vereis dat CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE op true gestel is in include/config.php; sonder daardie uitdruklike hek bly dit veilig in slegs-verslag-modus.  Geen laat ook onveilige eval()-aanroepe toe en is die mins beperkende opsie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Verstek)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Nonce-migrasie (Slegs verslag)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Nonce-afdwinging (Gevorderd)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "CSP-oortredingsverslag-URI"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Word gebruik in Nonce-migrasie- en Nonce-afdwingingsmodusse.  URL waarheen blaaiers Content-Security-Policy-oortredingsverslae pos.  Laat leeg om die gebundelde csp_report.php-hanteerder onder die gekonfigureerde Cacti-URL-pad te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Alternatiewe bronne vir Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Spasiegeskeide domeinname waartoe toegang buite die webbediener self toegelaat sal word.  Dit is belangrik vir gebruikers wat kies om 'n CDN of gasheerwerf te gebruik.  Bronne kan jokerkarakters insluit, byvoorbeeld: *.mydomain.com, of 'n protokol, byvoorbeeld: https://*.example.com.  Hierdie alternatiewe bronne sluit slegs beeld-, CSS- en JavaScript-tipes in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Aktiveer htmx vir in-plek filterbywerkings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Wanneer dit geaktiveer is, word die htmx-laaier ingesluit sodat bladsye wat intree hul filterresultate kan verfris sonder om die hele bladsy te herlaai. Deaktiveer slegs indien inproppe wangedra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Aan (verstek)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Af"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Afgeleë agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Wanneer verskeie dataversamelaars gebruik word, is dit die instellings vir kommunikasie tussen dataversamelaars"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "TCP-poort"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Die TCP-poort wat gebruik word om met die afgeleë dataversamelaars te kommunikeer.  Die protokol sal ooreenstem met die sentrale Cacti-webbediener (óf HTTP óf HTTPS).  Laat leeg om die verstekpoorte te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Die tydsduur, in sekondes, wat die sentrale Cacti-webbediener sal wag vir 'n reaksie van die afgeleë dataversamelaar om verskeie toestelinligting te verkry voordat die versoek laat vaar word.  Op toestelle wat geassosieer word met ander dataversamelaars as die sentrale Cacti-dataversamelaar, moet die afgeleë agent gebruik word om toestelinligting in te samel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Verifieer TLS-sertifikate van afgeleë agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Vereis 'n vertroude sertifikaat waarvan die naam ooreenstem met die gasheernaam van die afgeleë dataversamelaar. Deaktiveer slegs terwyl verouderde selfondertekende sertifikate vervang word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Nee (verouderde selfondertekende sertifikaat)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "CA-lêer vir afgeleë agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Opsionele absolute pad na 'n PEM CA-bundel wat gebruik word om afgeleë dataversamelaar-sertifikate te verifieer. Laat leeg om die PHP/OpenSSL-stelselvertrouestoor te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Logvlak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Die logvlak vir outomatiseringsaktiwiteite.  Vlakke is Laag, Medium en Hoog."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Dwing seriële outomatiseringskanderings af"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Wanneer dit geaktiveer is, sal Cacti-outomatisering een netwerk op 'n slag skandeer en nie parallel nie.  Hierdie instelling kan nuttig wees wanneer jou Cacti-webbedieners beperkte kerns het om outomatiseringskontroles uit te voer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Aktiveer outomatiese grafiekskepping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer dit gedeaktiveer is, sal Cacti-outomatisering nie aktief enige grafiek skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer toestelinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe grafieke geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Dit sal steeds moontlik wees om outomatiseringsreëls handmatig aan te roep."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Aktiveer outomatiese boomitem-skepping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer dit gedeaktiveer is, sal Cacti-outomatisering nie aktief enige boomitem skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer toestel- of grafiekinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe boominskrywings geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Dit sal steeds moontlik wees om reëls handmatig aan te roep."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing Aan-e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Die e-posadres waarheen outomatiseringskennisgewing-e-posse gestuur moet word indien dit nie op die outomatiseringsnetwerkvlak gespesifiseer is nie.  Indien óf hierdie veld óf die outomatiseringsnetwerkwaarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die primêre Cacti-administrateur se e-posrekening gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing Van-naam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Die e-posnaam om te gebruik vir outomatiseringskennisgewing-e-posse indien dit nie op die outomatiseringsnetwerkvlak gespesifiseer is nie.  Indien óf hierdie veld óf die outomatiseringsnetwerkwaarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die stelsel se verstek Van-naam gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Outomatiseringskennisgewing Van-e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Die e-posadres om te gebruik vir outomatiseringskennisgewing-e-posse indien dit nie op die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-vlak gespesifiseer is nie. Indien óf hierdie veld óf die Outomatiseringsnetwerk-waarde leeg gelaat word, sal Cacti die stelselverstek Van-e-posadres gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Grafieksjabloon-verstekwaardes"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Grafieksjabloon Toetsdatabron"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Merk hierdie merkblokkie as jy die databronne wil toets voordat dit geskep word vir nuwe en pas ingevoerde grafieksjablone. Wanneer Toetsdatabronne geaktiveer is, en die databron nie geldige data terugstuur nie, sal die grafiek nie geskep word nie. Hierdie instelling is belangrik as jy 'n meer generiese toestelsjabloon wil hê wat meer grafieksjablone kan insluit wat selektief toegepas kan word afhangende van die eienskappe van die toestel self. Let wel: As jy 'n lanklopende skrip as 'n databron het, sal die tyd om grafieke te skep verleng word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Die verstek beeldformaat wat vir alle nuwe grafieksjablone gebruik moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Die verstek grafiekhoogte wat vir alle nuwe grafieksjablone gebruik moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Die verstek grafiekbreedte wat vir alle nuwe grafieksjablone gebruik moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "General Defaults"
msgstr "Algemene verstekwaardes"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Device Template used on all new Devices."
msgstr "Die verstek toestelsjabloon wat op alle nuwe toestelle gebruik word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Site for all new Devices."
msgstr "Die verstek terrein vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Poller for all new Devices."
msgstr "Die verstek peiler vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Threads"
msgstr "Toesteldrade"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of Device Threads.  This is only applicable when using the Spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die verstek aantal toesteldrade. Dit is slegs van toepassing wanneer die Spine-dataversamelaar gebruik word."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Thread"
msgstr "%s draad"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Threads"
msgstr "%s drade"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-index Method for Data Queries"
msgstr "Herindekseringsmetode vir datanavrae"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Re-index Method to use for all Data Queries."
msgstr "Die verstek herindekseringsmetode om vir alle datanavrae te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Interface Speed"
msgstr "Verstek koppelvlakspoed"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Cacti can not determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Indien Cacti nie die koppelvlakspoed kan bepaal nie omdat óf ifSpeed óf ifHighSpeed nie gestel is nie of nul is, watter maksimum waarde wil jy op die gevolglike RRD-lêers hê."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "100 Mbps Ethernet"
msgstr "100 Mbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "1 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "10 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "10 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "25 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "25 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "40 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "40 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "56 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "56 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "100 Gbps Ethernet"
msgstr "100 Gbps Ethernet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Defaults"
msgstr "SNMP-verstekwaardes"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP version for all new Devices."
msgstr "Verstek SNMP-weergawe vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP read community for all new Devices."
msgstr "Verstek SNMP-leesgemeenskap vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Security Level"
msgstr "Sekuriteitsvlak"

#: include/global_settings.php
