msgstr "Verstek SNMP-herpogings vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "moet 'n nie-negatiewe heelgetal wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "SNMP-gedrag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "SNMP-agentondersteuning geaktiveer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "As hierdie opsie gemerk is, sal Cacti SNMP-agenttabelle met Cacti-toestel- en stelselinligting vul. Dit aktiveer nie die SNMP-agent self nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Aktiveer MD5 en DES vir SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Die MD5-verifikasie- en DES-privaatheidsalgoritmes is verouderd, swak en onbeskikbaar op verharde (FIPS) PHP- en Net-SNMP-bouweergawes. Wanneer gedeaktiveer, word MD5 en DES verwyder uit die SNMPv3-verifikasie- en privaatheidsprotokol-aftreklyste wat gewys word wanneer 'n toestel gewysig word en in die Outomatisering-SNMP-opsies, wat slegs die sterker SHA- en AES-algoritmes oorlaat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Aktiveer geloofsbriefkas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Verhard vooraf en kas SNMPv3-geloofsbriefargumente een keer per geloofsbriefwysiging sodat elke peilerproses dit hergebruik in plaas daarvan om dit by elke versoek te herbou. Dit lewer 'n marginale besparing wanneer met SNMPv3-geloofsbriewe deur die Net-SNMP-binêre lêers versamel word. Die php-snmp-uitbreiding hanteer die meeste SNMPv3-get-versoeke binne-proses en omseil hierdie kas, maar die Net-SNMP-binêre lêers (en dus hierdie kas) word steeds gebruik vir SNMP-walks, heks-afvoer, versoeke wat 'n konteks of enjin-ID stel, en protokolkombinasies wat die lopende PHP-weergawe nie ondersteun nie. Aktiveer dit as jy enige van daardie werkladings met SNMPv3-geloofsbriewe versamel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Maks. OID-limiet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Die verstek maksimum aantal SNMP Get-OID's om per snmpget-versoek uit te reik. Vir toestelle word hierdie instelling op toestelvlak beheer. Jy behoort hierdie instelling slegs te gebruik wanneer jy Cacti se SNMP-API direk in jou skripte of inproppe gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Bulkwalk-haalgrootte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Hoeveel OID's moet per snmpbulkwalk-versoek teruggestuur word?  Vir Toestelle met groot SNMP-bome sal die verhoging van hierdie grootte die herindekseringswerkverrigting oor 'n WAN verbeter."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Deaktiveer kontrole vir toenemende OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Beheer die deaktivering van die kontrole vir toenemende OID tydens die deurloop van die OID-boom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Beskikbaarheid/Bereikbaarheid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Verstek Beskikbaarheid/Bereikbaarheid vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Die metode wat Cacti sal gebruik om te bepaal of 'n Toestel beskikbaar is vir peiling.  <br><i>LET WEL: Dit word aanbeveel dat SNMP ten minste altyd gekies word.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device SNMP Recovery Options Retry Frequency"
msgstr "Herprobeerfrekwensie vir SNMP-herstelopsies van Toestelle wat af is"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When a Device is Down, and has an SNMP Recovery Options Set established, how often do you wish to try to retry the Device using the SNMP Options Set specified?"
msgstr "Wanneer 'n Toestel af is en 'n stel SNMP-herstelopsies opgestel is, hoe gereeld wil u probeer om die Toestel weer te kontak met die gespesifiseerde stel SNMP-opsies?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Ping-tipe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Verstek Ping-tipe vir alle nuwe Toestelle.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Verstek Ping-poort vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Met TCP sal Cacti probeer om 'n Syn op die poort uit te voer.  Met UDP vereis Cacti óf 'n suksesvolle verbinding óf 'n 'poort nie bereikbaar nie'-fout om te bepaal of die Toestel op is al dan nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Verstek Ping-uitteltydwaarde in millisekondes vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Die uitteltydwaardes wat gebruik word vir Toestel-SNMP-, ICMP-, UDP- en TCP-pinging.  ICMP-pings sal opgerond word na die naaste sekonde.  TCP- en UDP-verbindinguitteltye op Windows word deur die bedryfstelsel beheer en word dus nie op Windows aanbeveel nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Die aantal kere wat Cacti sal probeer om 'n Toestel te ping voordat dit as af gemerk word."

