msgstr "Eenheidslettertipe-instelling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The font to use for Graph Unit items.  Enter either a valid True Type Font file or valid Pango font-config value."
msgstr "Die lettertipe om vir grafiekeenheid-items te gebruik. Voer óf 'n geldige TrueType-lettertipelêer óf 'n geldige Pango font-config-waarde in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Data-insameling geaktiveer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "As jy die peilingsproses heeltemal wil stop, ontmerk hierdie blokkie."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Peilertipe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Die peilertipe om te gebruik. Hierdie instelling sal by die volgende peilingsinterval in werking tree."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Die peilingsinterval wat gebruik word. Hierdie instelling sal beïnvloed hoe gereeld RRD-lêers nagegaan en opgedateer word. <strong><u>LET WEL: As jy hierdie waarde verander, moet jy die peilerkas hervul. Versuim om dit te doen, kan tot verlore data lei.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "is nie 'n geldige keuse nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Cron/Daemon-interval"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Die frekwensie waarmee die Cacti-data-insamelaar begin sal word. Jy kan óf crontab, 'n geskeduleerde taak (vir Windows), óf die cactid systemd-diens gebruik om die bekendstelling van die Cacti-data-insamelaar te beheer. Vir instruksies oor die gebruik van die cactid-daemon, hersien die README.md-lêer in die diensgids."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Balanseer proseslading"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "As jy hierdie opsie kies, sal Cacti probeer om die lading van elke peilerproses te balanseer deur peileritems gelykop per proses te versprei."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ontfoutingsafvoerwydte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "As jy hierdie opsie kies, sal Cacti kyk vir afvoer wat Cacti se vermoë om dit te stoor oorskry en 'n waarskuwing uitreik wanneer dit gevind word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Afgeleë agent-tyduitloop"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Verfris peilertabel per siklus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Hierdie instelling is slegs vir enkelpeilerstelsels om die peiler-afvoertabel tydens elke peilingsiklus te herbou om te verhoed dat die geheuetabel omruil (swap) op baie groot stelsels met groot databasisse wat swap kan gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Data-insamelaar-replikasie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Peiler-sinkroniseringsinterval"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Die verstek peiling-sinkroniseringsinterval om te gebruik wanneer 'n peiler geskep word. Hierdie instelling sal beïnvloed hoe gereeld afgeleë peilers nagegaan en opgedateer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Deaktiveer hulpbronkas-replikasie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "By verstek sal die hoof-Cacti-dataversamelaar die hele webwerf en inproppe in 'n hulpbronkas berg. Daarna sal die afgeleë dataversamelaars hulself periodiek opdateer met enige opdaterings vanaf die hoof-Cacti-dataversamelaar. Hierdie hulpbronkas laat afgeleë dataversamelaars in wese toe om hulself op te gradeer. As jy nie hierdie opsie wil gebruik nie, kan jy dit met hierdie instelling deaktiveer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Deaktiveer outomatiese volle sinchronisasie tydens opgradering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "By verstek sal die hoof-Cacti-stelsel tydens opgradering 'n volle sinchronisasie na alle dataversamelaars uitvoer. Hierdie proses kan tydrowend wees. Om opgraderings vinniger te laat voltooi, bied ons dus hierdie opsie. Let daarop dat indien dit gedeaktiveer is, die Cacti-administrateur hierdie proses ná opgradering vanuit die dataversamelaars-koppelvlak moet forseer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Bykomende dataversamelaar-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Boekstawing van ongeldige data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Hoe wil jy hê dat die dataversamelaar se afvoerfoute aangeteken word? Opsies sluit in: 'Gedetailleerd' wat elke fout uiteensit, 'Opsomming' wat die aantal afvoerfoute per toestel verskaf, en 'Geen', wat geen fouttellings verskaf nie."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Opsomming"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Gedetailleerd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Aantal PHP-skripbedieners"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige skripbedienerprosesse om per spine-proses te laat loop. Instellings tussen 1 en 15 word aanvaar. Hierdie parameter sal help as jy verskeie drade en skripbedienerskripte laat loop, en is slegs geldig vir die spine-dataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Tydlimietwaarde vir skrip en skripbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat spine sal wag vir 'n skrip om te voltooi. Hierdie tydlimietwaarde is in sekondes en geldig vir beide cmd.php- en spine-dataversamelaars."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Ontdendering vir nie-leë peilerafvoer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "As jy probleme met sommige databronne ondervind, kan jou e-pos oorstroom word met 'Poller Output Not Empty'-waarskuwings. As dit gebeur, kan jy die instelling op grond van hierdie interval ontdender."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Periodieke herindeksering van alle toestelle"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Skedule vir herindeksering van alle toestelle"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Teen watter frekwensie wil jy alle toestelle herindekseer? Hierdie herindeksering sal om middernag plaasvind teen die frekwensie wat jy kies."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Weekliks op Sondag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Maandeliks op Sondag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Runtime Variation/Deviance Settings"
msgstr "Instellings vir looptydvariasie/-afwyking"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Count Warning Threshold"
msgstr "Waarskuwingsdrempel vir een-uur-telling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Wanneer die beskermde peilerverhouding (hieronder) meer as soveel keer binne 'n uur oorskry word, sal 'n waarskuwing na die Cacti-logboek geskryf word en 'n e-pos aan die primêre Cacti-administrateur gestuur word om hulle van die peiler se looptydafwyking in kennis te stel."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycle"
msgstr "%d peilersiklus"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycles"
msgstr "%d peilersiklusse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "Een-uur beskermde peilerverhouding gemiddelde/maks. looptyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Define a Guarded Poller Ratio average/max runtime (in percent).  Cacti will track breaches in these statistics and issue warnings to the Primary Cacti Administrator via Email when they happen."
msgstr "Definieer 'n beskermde peilerverhouding se gemiddelde/maksimum looptyd (in persent). Cacti sal oorskrydings van hierdie statistieke dophou en waarskuwings per e-pos aan die primêre Cacti-administrateur stuur wanneer dit plaasvind."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Percent"
msgstr "%d persent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "24 Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "24-uur beskermde peilerverhouding gemiddelde/maks. looptyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Running Tasks"
msgstr "Maksimum lopende take"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of concurrent scheduled tasks allowed to run concurrently."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal gelyktydige geskeduleerde take wat toegelaat word om gelyktydig te loop."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Scheduled Task"
msgstr "1 geskeduleerde taak"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Scheduled Tasks"
msgstr "%d geskeduleerde take"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Maximum Task Runtime"
msgstr "Verstek maksimum taaklooptyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Scheduled Task can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat 'n geskeduleerde taak kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minuut"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Miscelanious Task Parallelism and Timeouts"
msgstr "Diverse taakparallellisme en tydlimiete"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For Tasks not managed by the Cacti Scheduler, there are their parallelism and timeout settings"
msgstr "Vir take wat nie deur die Cacti-skeduleerder bestuur word nie, is hier hul parallellisme- en tydlimietinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir databronstatistieke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se databronstatistieke-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile Check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se RRDfile-kontroleskrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s uur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir peileropdragte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se agtergrondopdragte-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word. Hierdie skrip sal take uitvoer soos die herindeksering van toestelle en die snoei van toestelle vanaf afgeleë dataversamelaars."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Gelyktydige prosesse vir peileropdragte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige peileropdrag-prosesse. Daar sal hoogstens een gelyktydige opdrag per gasheer binne die peileropdragpoel wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir agtergrondgenerering van instandhouding"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se instandhoudingskrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir agtergrondgenerering van Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se Spikekill-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Stawingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ingeboude stawing</i> - Cacti hanteer gebruikerstawing, wat jou toelaat om gebruikers te skep en aan hulle regte tot verskillende areas binne Cacti te gee.<br><br><i>Basiese webstawing</i> - Stawing word deur die webbediener hanteer. Gebruikers kan outomaties bygevoeg of geskep word by die eerste aanmelding indien die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, andersins sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word.<br><br><i>LDAP-stawing</i> - Laat stawing teen 'n LDAP-bediener toe. Gebruikers sal outomaties geskep word by die eerste aanmelding indien die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, andersins sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word. Indien PHP se LDAP-module nie geaktiveer is nie, sal LDAP-stawing nie as 'n kiesbare opsie verskyn nie.<br><br><i>Meervoudige LDAP/AD-domeinstawing</i> - Laat administrateurs toe om verskeie afsonderlike groepe van verskillende LDAP/AD-gidse te ondersteun om toegang tot Cacti-hulpbronne te verkry. Net soos LDAP-stawing, word die PHP LDAP-module vereis om hierdie metode te gebruik.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Ondersteun stawingkoekies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use.  Note, the client must use HTTPS to leverage this feature."
msgstr "Indien 'n gebruiker staaf en 'Hou my aangemeld' kies, sal 'n stawingkoekie op die gebruiker se rekenaar geskep word wat daardie gebruiker toelaat om aangemeld te bly. Die stawingkoekie verval na 90 dae van nie-gebruik. Let wel, die kliënt moet HTTPS gebruik om hierdie kenmerk te benut."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Settings"
msgstr "Onderhoudinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Lockout Type"
msgstr "Onderhouduitsluitingtipe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Cacti system is locked out for maintenance, how do you want the maintenance enforced?"
msgstr "Wanneer die Cacti-stelsel vir onderhoud uitgesluit is, hoe wil jy hê moet die onderhoud afgedwing word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Cacti Lockout Feature"
msgstr "Deaktiveer Cacti-uitsluitingskenmerk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin (all logins)"
msgstr "Primêre administrateur (alle aanmeldings)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin (lockout session only)"
msgstr "Primêre administrateur (slegs uitsluitingsessie)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Spesiale gebruikers"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primêre administrateur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Die naam van die primêre administratiewe rekening wat outomaties e-posse sal ontvang wanneer die Cacti-stelsel probleme ondervind. Om hierdie e-posse te ontvang, maak seker dat jou e-posinstellings korrek is en dat die administratiewe rekening 'n e-posadres het wat gestel is."

#: include/global_settings.php login_providers.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Geen gebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gasgebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Die naam van die gasgebruiker vir die besigtiging van grafieke; is by verstek 'Geen gebruiker'."

#: include/global_settings.php login_providers.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Gebruikersjabloon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Die naam van die gebruiker wat Cacti as 'n sjabloon sal gebruik vir nuwe basiese web- en LDAP-gebruikers; is by verstek 'guest'. Hierdie gebruikersrekening sal gedeaktiveer word om aan te meld sodra dit gekies word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Sluiting van rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Sluit rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Sluit 'n rekening na hierdie aantal mislukte pogings binne 1 uur."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 poging"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pogings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Outomatiese ontsluiting"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "'n Rekening sal outomaties na hierdie aantal minute ontsluit word. Selfs al word die korrekte wagwoord ingevoer, sal die rekening nie ontsluit word voordat hierdie tydsbeperking bereik is nie. Maksimum van 1440 minute (1 dag)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Checks (Online)"
msgstr "Pwned-kontroles (aanlyn)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Check"
msgstr "Pwned-kontrole"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check password against haveibeenpwned.com"
msgstr "Kontroleer wagwoord teen haveibeenpwned.com"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Threshold"
msgstr "Pwned-drempel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Block use of a password once it reaches this reported usage level"
msgstr "Blokkeer die gebruik van 'n wagwoord sodra dit hierdie gerapporteerde gebruiksvlak bereik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Localized 2FA"
msgstr "Gelokaliseerde 2FA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Localized 2FA"
msgstr "Aktiveer gelokaliseerde 2FA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this option if you wish users to locally enable Two Factor Authentication for their accounts.  Note that most Enterprise level MFA does not require intervention by the Cacti Administrator."
msgstr "Merk hierdie opsie indien jy wil hê gebruikers moet tweefaktorstawing plaaslik vir hul rekeninge aktiveer. Let wel dat meeste ondernemingsvlak-MFA nie ingryping deur die Cacti-administrateur vereis nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Token Lifetime"
msgstr "Bewystekenlewensduur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long the Two Factor Auth Token lasts before being rechecked up to a max of 1 week."
msgstr "Hoe lank die tweefaktorstawing-bewysteken hou voordat dit weer gekontroleer word, tot 'n maksimum van 1 week."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Basiese stawinginstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Mislukte aanmeldingsboodskap vir basiese stawing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese stawing gebruik word en daar probleme is om die gebruikersnaam na 'n geldige Cacti-rekening te karteer, sal die boodskap wat hier ingesluit is aan gebruikers vertoon word. Dit kan beide teks en HTML insluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Karteringslêer vir basiese stawing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese stawing gebruik word en die basiese rekening na 'n ander aanmeldingsrekening omgeskakel moet word, kan jy hier 'n CSV-lêer spesifiseer om die basiese rekening na die verlangde aanmeldingsrekening te karteer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Kompleksiteitsvereistes vir plaaslike rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimum lengte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Dit is die minimum lengte van toegelate wagwoorde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Vereis gemengde letterkas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde beide klein- en hoofletters bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Vereis syfer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 numeriese karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Vereis spesiale karakter"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 spesiale karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Dwing kompleksiteit op ou wagwoorde af"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat alle ou wagwoorde ook by aanmelding aan die nuwe kompleksiteitsvereistes voldoen. Indien nie, sal dit 'n wagwoordverandering afdwing."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Verval onaktiewe rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Dit is die maksimum aantal dae voordat onaktiewe rekeninge gedeaktiveer word. Die Admin-rekening is van hierdie beleid uitgesluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Verval wagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Dit is die maksimum aantal dae voordat 'n wagwoord gestel word om te verval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Wagwoordgeskiedenis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Onthou hierdie aantal ou wagwoorde en verbied die hergebruik daarvan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 Verandering"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d Veranderinge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Email Notification"
msgstr "Rekening-e-poskennisgewing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Send email to new user"
msgstr "Stuur e-pos aan nuwe gebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an admin creates a new account and an email address is entered, send an informational email to it."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n administrateur 'n nuwe rekening skep en 'n e-posadres ingevoer word, stuur 'n inligtings-e-pos daarnatoe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Subject of new account message"
msgstr "Onderwerp van boodskap vir nuwe rekening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be used for a new account message."
msgstr "Dit is die e-posonderwerp wat vir 'n boodskap vir 'n nuwe rekening gebruik sal word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email body for new account message"
msgstr "E-posinhoud vir boodskap oor nuwe rekening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the message that will be send to new user account. Max 1024 characters. HTML is allowed. There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"
msgstr "Dit is die boodskap wat aan 'n nuwe gebruikersrekening gestuur sal word. Maks. 1024 karakters. HTML word toegelaat. Daar is verskeie algemene vervangingsmerkers wat gebruik kan word, insluitend &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "New Cacti account created. <br>Server: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Username: <USERNAME><br>To login and set a new password, click the <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">password reset link</a><br><br>"
msgstr "Nuwe Cacti-rekening geskep. <br>Bediener: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Gebruikersnaam: <USERNAME><br>Om aan te meld en 'n nuwe wagwoord op te stel, klik op die <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">wagwoordterugstelskakel</a><br><br>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Send email when an admin changes an account password"
msgstr "Stuur e-pos wanneer 'n administrateur 'n rekeningwagwoord verander"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an admin changes the password of an account and the email address for that account is entered, an informational email will be sent to that address."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n administrateur die wagwoord van 'n rekening verander en die e-posadres vir daardie rekening ingevoer is, sal 'n inligtings-e-pos na daardie adres gestuur word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Subject of password reset message"
msgstr "Onderwerp van wagwoordterugstelboodskap"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be used when an admin changes an account password or a user uses 'Forgot password'."
msgstr "Dit is die e-posonderwerp wat gebruik sal word wanneer 'n administrateur 'n rekeningwagwoord verander of 'n gebruiker 'Wagwoord vergeet' gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti password reset"
msgstr "Cacti-wagwoordterugstelling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email body for password reset message"
msgstr "E-posinhoud vir wagwoordterugstelboodskap"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the message that will be sent when a user requests a password reset. Max 1024 characters. HTML is allowed. There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"
msgstr "Dit is die boodskap wat gestuur sal word wanneer 'n gebruiker 'n wagwoordterugstelling versoek. Maks. 1024 karakters. HTML word toegelaat. Daar is verskeie algemene vervangingsmerkers wat gebruik kan word, insluitend &#060CACTIURL&#062 &#060USERNAME&#062 &#060PASSWORD&#062"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Your account password has been reset. <br>Server: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Username: <USERNAME><br>To set a new password, click the <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">password reset link</a><br><br>"
msgstr "Jou rekeningwagwoord is teruggestel. <br>Bediener: <a href=\"<CACTIURL>\"><CACTIURL></a><br>Gebruikersnaam: <USERNAME><br>Om 'n nuwe wagwoord op te stel, klik op die <a href=\"<PWDRESETLINK>\">wagwoordterugstelskakel</a><br><br>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reset link validity"
msgstr "Geldigheid van terugstelskakel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long the password reset link is valid in minutes"
msgstr "Hoe lank die wagwoordterugstelskakel geldig is in minute"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL-koppeling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Bediener-basis-URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site. This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Dit is die bedienerligging wat vir skakels na die Cacti-werf gebruik sal word. Dit moet die subgids insluit indien Cacti nie vanaf die wortelgids loop nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "E-posopsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Stel Primêre Administrateur in kennis van probleme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Moet die Primêre Administrateur per e-pos in kennis gestel word in gevalle waar die Cacti-bediener probleme ondervind? Die Primêre Administrateur se Cacti-gebruikersrekening word onder die Verifikasie-oortjie op Cacti se instellingsbladsy gespesifiseer. Dit is by verstek die 'admin'-rekening."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Toets-e-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Dit is 'n e-posrekening wat gebruik word om 'n toetsboodskap te stuur om te verseker dat alles behoorlik werk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Posdienste"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Watter posdiens om te gebruik om pos te stuur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Ping posbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Ping die posbediener voordat toets-e-pos gestuur word?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Van-e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Dit is die e-posadres wat as die afsender van die e-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Van-naam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from. Not used for OAuth2 method."
msgstr "Dit is die werklike naam wat as die afsender van die e-pos sal verskyn. Word nie vir die OAuth2-metode gebruik nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Woordomvou"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Dit is hoeveel karakters toegelaat sal word voordat 'n reël in die e-pos outomaties omgevou word. (0 = Gedeaktiveer)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Sendmail-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Sendmail-pad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Dit is die pad na sendmail op jou bediener. (Word slegs gebruik as Sendmail as die Posdiens gekies is)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "SMTP-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "SMTP-gasheernaam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Dit is die gasheernaam/IP van die SMTP-bediener waarna jy die e-pos sal stuur. Vir oorskakeling (failover), skei jou gashere met 'n kommapunt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP-poort"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Die poort op die SMTP-bediener om te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer."
msgstr "moet 'n positiewe heelgetal wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP-gebruikersnaam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam om mee te verifieer wanneer via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg indien jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP-wagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die wagwoord om mee te verifieer wanneer via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg indien jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP-sekuriteit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Die enkripsiemetode om vir die e-pos te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die SMTP-uitteltyd in sekondes in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth 2 Options"
msgstr "OAuth 2-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Provider"
msgstr "OAuth2-verskaffer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose your OAuth2 provider."
msgstr "Kies jou OAuth2-verskaffer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Email address connected with your oauth."
msgstr "E-posadres wat aan jou oauth gekoppel is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Client ID"
msgstr "OAuth2-kliënt-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter OAuth Client"
msgstr "Voer asseblief OAuth-kliënt in"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Client Secret"
msgstr "OAuth2-kliëntgeheim"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter OAuth secret"
msgstr "Voer asseblief OAuth-geheim in"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Azure Tenant ID"
msgstr "Azure-huurder-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only relevant for Azure"
msgstr "Slegs relevant vir Azure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 Redirect URI"
msgstr "OAuth2-herlei-URI"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please check this URI. It could be accessible from internet."
msgstr "Kontroleer asseblief hierdie URI. Dit kan vanaf die internet toeganklik wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "OAuth2 refresh token"
msgstr "OAuth2-vernuwingstoken"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "You can insert here OAuth2 refresh token directly, if you know it. Second option is retrieved from oauth2 provider. In this case set correct OAuth2 setting, save setting and open new browser tab or window and go to OAuth2 Redirect URI"
msgstr "U kan die OAuth2-vernuwingstoken direk hier invoeg as u dit ken. Die tweede opsie is om dit van die OAuth2-verskaffer te verkry. In hierdie geval, stel die korrekte OAuth2-instelling, stoor die instelling, maak 'n nuwe blaaier-oortjie of -venster oop en gaan na die OAuth2-herleidings-URI"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Voorafinstellings vir verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Verstek grafiekbeeldformaat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "Watter beeldtipe moet vir inlyn-grafieke gebruik word wanneer 'n nuwe verslag geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum E-Mail Size"
msgstr "Maksimum e-posgrootte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Die maksimum grootte van die e-posboodskap insluitend alle aanhangsels."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "Aantekenvlak van die peiler vir Cacti-verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Watter vlak van besonderhede wil u na die loglêer stuur. WAARSKUWING: As dit op enige ander status as NONE of LOW gelaat word, kan dit u skyfspasie vinnig uitput."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "DNS-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primêre DNS-IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die primêre DNS-IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekondêre DNS-IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die sekondêre DNS-IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "DNS-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die DNS-uitteltyd in millisekondes in. Cacti gebruik 'n PHP-gebaseerde DNS-oplosser."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Internet-instaanbedienerinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Address"
msgstr "Internet-instaanbedieneradres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For either core Cacti Services or Plugins that require internet access, enter the proxy server and port here in the following format IP:PORT.  For example 192.168.1.1:8080."
msgstr "Vir óf kern-Cacti-dienste óf inproppe wat internettoegang benodig, voer die instaanbediener en poort hier in die volgende formaat in: IP:PORT. Byvoorbeeld 192.168.1.1:8080."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy User"
msgstr "Internet-instaanbedienergebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If your Internet Proxy requires a username, enter it here."
msgstr "As u internet-instaanbediener 'n gebruikersnaam vereis, voer dit hier in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Internet Proxy Password"
msgstr "Internet-instaanbedienerwagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If your Internet Proxy requires a password, enter it here."
msgstr "As u internet-instaanbediener 'n wagwoord vereis, voer dit hier in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Instellings vir RRD-opdatering op aanvraag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Aktiveer RRD-opdatering op aanvraag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Moet Boost RRD-opdatering op aanvraag in Cacti aktiveer? As u dit deaktiveer, sal hierdie verandering eers ná die volgende peilingsiklus in werking tree. Wanneer u afgeleë dataversamelaars het, moet hierdie instelling geaktiveer wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Stelselvlak-RRD-opdateerder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Voordat RRD-opdatering op aanvraag skoongemaak kan word, moet 'n peilerlopie altyd voltooi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet Boost alle RRD's opdateer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Wanneer u Boost aktiveer, word u RRD-lêers slegs opgedateer wanneer dit deur 'n gebruiker versoek word, of wanneer hierdie tydperk verstryk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Aantal Boost-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige Boost-prosesse om te gebruik om al die RRD's in die Boost-tabel te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimum rekords"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "As die Boost-afvoertabel hierdie grootte, in rekords, oorskry, sal 'n opdatering plaasvind."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maksimum databron-items per deurloop"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Om werkverrigting te optimaliseer, moet die Boost-RRD-opdateerder weet hoeveel databron-items in een deurloop herwin moet word. Wees asseblief versigtig om dit nie te hoog te stel nie, aangesien grafiekwerkverrigting tydens groot opdaterings benadeel kan word. As u stadige grafieke of peiling tydens opdaterings ervaar, verlaag hierdie getal. Die verstekwaarde is 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimum argumentlengte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Wanneer Boost opdateringsopdragte na RRDtool stuur, mag dit nie die bedryfstelsel se maksimum argumentlengte oorskry nie. Dit wissel volgens bedryfstelsel en kernvlak. Byvoorbeeld: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ onbeperk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Geheuelimiet vir Boost en peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid geheue vir die Cacti-peiler en Boost se peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimum looptyd vir RRD-opdateringskrip"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "As die Boost-peiler hierdie looptyd oorskry, sal 'n waarskuwing in die Cacti-logboek geplaas word,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Aktiveer Boost-ontfouting"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
msgstr "Indien gestel, sal Boost ontfoutingsinligting direk na die Boost-loglêer aanteken. Neem asseblief kennis dat aktivering 'n hoë I/O-tempo op die plaaslike lêerstelsel kan veroorsaak."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Beeldkasberging"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Aktiveer beeldkasberging"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Moet beeldkasberging geaktiveer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Ligging vir beeldlêers"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die ligging waar Boost u beeldlêers moet plaas. Hierdie lêers sal outomaties deur die peiler verwyder word wanneer dit verval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Databronne-statistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Aktiveer insameling van databronstatistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Moet databronstatistiek vir hierdie Cacti-stelsel ingesamel word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Method"
msgstr "Data-insamelingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics can use a legacy method where it will determine peak and average values, or an advanced mode which will calculated several additional statistical values in addition to peak and average.  Using All Statistical Metrics can place additional CPU and IO load on the system."
msgstr "Databronstatistiek kan 'n ouer metode gebruik waar dit piek- en gemiddelde waardes sal bepaal, of 'n gevorderde modus wat verskeie bykomende statistiese waardes benewens piek en gemiddeld sal bereken. Die gebruik van Alle statistiese maatstawwe kan bykomende CPU- en IO-lading op die stelsel plaas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Peak/Average Only"
msgstr "Slegs piek/gemiddeld"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Statistical Metrics"
msgstr "Alle statistiese maatstawwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Calculate Peaks Stats in Addition to Average Stats"
msgstr "Bereken piekstatistiek benewens gemiddelde statistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php
