msgstr "MySQL - Instellings"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Hierdie MySQL-werkverrigtinginstellings sal u Cacti-stelsel help om langer beter te presteer sonder probleme."

#: lib/installer.php
