#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Alle vouers is skryfbaar"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Linux-kernsekuriteitsmodules"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Cacti moet netwerkverbindings tot stand bring, binêre lêers uitvoer en lêers skryf om te werk. Linux-sekuriteitskenmerke soos <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> of <b>ModSecurity</b> kan veroorsaak dat Cacti in sommige konfigurasies onbruikbaar word. As probleme voorkom, gaan die instellings van hierdie sekuriteitsnutsgoed na.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Beskerming met witlys vir invoervalidering"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Cacti-data-invoermetodes wat 'n skrip aanroep kan op maniere uitgebuit word waardeur 'n nie-administrateur skade kan aanrig aan lêers wat deur die peilerrekening besit word, en in gevalle waar iemand die Cacti-peiler as root laat loop, die bedryfstelsel kan kompromitteer en aanvallers toelaat om jou infrastruktuur uit te buit."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Daarom is Cacti etlike weergawes gelede verbeter om witlysvermoëns vir hierdie tipe data-invoermetodes te bied.  Hoewel dit Cacti meer deeglik beveilig, verhoog dit wel die hoeveelheid werk wat van die Cacti-administrateur vereis word om sjablone en pakkette in te voer en te bestuur."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Die manier waarop die witlys werk, is dat wanneer jy 'n data-invoermetode vir die eerste keer invoer, of 'n data-invoermetode herinvoer, en die skrip en/of argumente op enige manier verander, die data-invoermetode en al die ooreenstemmende databronne onmiddellik gedeaktiveer sal word totdat die administrateur bevestig dat die data-invoermetode geldig is."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Om Datainvoermetodes in hierdie toestand te help identifiseer, het ons 'n valideringskrip in Cacti se CLI-gids voorsien wat met die volgende opsies uitgevoer kan word:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Hierdie skripopsie sal soek na enige Datainvoermetodes wat tans verban is en besonderhede verskaf oor hoekom."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Hierdie skripopsie hef die verbanning op van die Datainvoermetodes wat tans verban is."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Hierdie skripopsie sal enige gedeaktiveerde Databronne weer aktiveer."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Dit word sterk aanbeveel dat u u config.php opdateer om hierdie kenmerk te aktiveer deur die kommentaarmerkers by die <b>$input_whitelist</b>-veranderlike te verwyder en dan die drie CLI-skripopsies hierbo uit te voer nadat die webgebaseerde installasie voltooi is.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Merk die merkblokkie hieronder om te erken dat u hierdie sekuriteitsbekommernis gelees het en verstaan"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Ek het hierdie verklaring gelees"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Admin-e-posadres"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "In geval van probleme kan Cacti e-posse aan die administrateur stuur. Die adres wat hier ingevul word, sal aan die admin-rekening toegewys word en \"Stel primêre admin in kennis van probleem\" sal geaktiveer word. U kan hierdie instelling en die e-posadres later verander. Moenie vergeet om die e-posinstellings ná installasie op te stel nie."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Verstekprofiel"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Kies asseblief die verstek-Databronprofiel wat vir peilbronne gebruik moet word. Dit is die maksimum tydsduur tussen die skandering van toestelle vir inligting, dus hoe laer die peilinterval, hoe meer werk word op die Cacti-bedienergasheer geplaas. Lang behoudprofiele stoor meer data, dus neem dit meer skyfkapasiteit op. Hul voordeel is dat ouer data nie so gekonsolideer is nie en dus akkurater is as wanneer korter behoud gebruik word."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Kies ook die beoogde of gekonfigureerde Cron-interval wat u vir Data-insameling wil gebruik."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Cron-interval"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Verstek-outomatiseringsnetwerk"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti kan die netwerk outomaties skandeer sodra die installasie voltooi is. Dit sal die netwerkreeks hieronder gebruik om die reeks IP's te bepaal wat skandeer kan word. 'n Voorafgedefinieerde stel opsies is vir skandering gedefinieer, wat die gebruik van beide 'public'- en 'private'-gemeenskappe insluit."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "As u toestelle vereis dat 'n ander stel opsies eerste gebruik word, kan u dit hieronder definieer en dit sal voor die verstekopsies gebruik word"

