#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Kies asseblief die Toestelsjablone wat u tydens die Opgradering wil opdateer."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Dit is nie raadsaam om Sjablone op te dateer waaraan u reeds wysigings aangebring het nie. Die Opgradering van die Sjablone sal NIE wysigings aan Grafiek- en Datasjablone verwyder nie, en kan tot onverwagte gedrag lei. As u egter geen veranderinge aan enige Grafiek-, Datanavraag- of Datasjabloon aangebring het nie, behoort die herinvoer van die Pakket geen uitwerking te hê nie. In daardie geval sal u ná die opdatering 'Sinchroniseer Grafieke' vanaf die Sjablone moet uitvoer."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Kies asseblief die Toestelsjablone wat u ná die Installasie wil gebruik. As u bedryfstelsel Windows is, moet u seker maak dat u die 'Windows Device'-sjabloon kies. As u bedryfstelsel Linux/UNIX is, maak seker dat u die 'Local Linux Machine'-toestelsjabloon kies."

