#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Peilerkas-administrasie"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Dit is die data wat elke keer aan die peiler gestuur word wanneer dit loop. Hierdie data word dan op sy beurt uitgevoer/geïnterpreteer en die resultate word in die RRD-lêers gevoer vir grafiekgenerering of in die databasis vir vertoon."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Die datanavraagkas stoor inligting wat uit datanavraag-invoertipes versamel is. Die waardes uit hierdie velde kan in die teksarea van grafieke vir legendes, vertikale etikette en GPRINT's sowel as in CDEF's gebruik word."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Herbou peilerkas"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Die peilerkas sal hergenereer word indien u hierdie opsie kies. Gebruik hierdie opsie slegs in die geval van 'n databasisomval as u probleme ondervind ná die omval en reeds die databasisherstelnutsgoed uitgevoer het.  Alternatiewelik, indien u probleme met 'n spesifieke toestel ondervind, stoor daardie toestel bloot weer om sy peilerkas te herbou.  Daar is ook 'n opdraglynkoppelvlak-ekwivalent vir hierdie opdrag wat vir groot stelsels aanbeveel word."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "LET WEL: Op groot stelsels kan hierdie opdrag etlike minute tot ure neem om te voltooi en moet dus nie vanaf die Cacti-gebruikerskoppelvlak uitgevoer word nie.  U kan bloot 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' op die opdraglyn uitvoer vir meer inligting."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Herbou hulpbronkas"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Wanneer veelvuldige dataversamelaars in Cacti bedryf word, sal Cacti poog om die status van sleutellêers op alle dataversamelaars in stand te hou.  Dit sluit alle kern-, nie-installasieverwante webwerf- en inproplêers in.  Wanneer u 'n herbou van die hulpbronkas afdwing, sal Cacti die plaaslike hulpbronkas skoonmaak en dit dan by die volgende geskeduleerde peilerbegin herbou.  Dit sal alle afgeleë dataversamelaars aanspoor om hul webwerf- en inproplêers vir konsekwentheid te herkontroleer."

